[2.963859, "o", "  Port Daddy is responsive (healthy)\r\n    Version: 3.27.0 (987fa7d919dd)\r\n    Binary: 82dd2895625c (installed)\r\n    PID: 1612\r\n    Uptime: 5m\r\n    Active ports: 0\r\n    Runtime: nominal\r\n    Health: ok\r\n    Control plane: converged — /health, daemon.pid, daemon.port, and Bosun heartbeat agree on PID 1612 at :9876\r\n    Fleet: 1 project(s), 21 agent(s), 19/21 launchable\r\n    Bosun: idle — daemon heartbeat writer active; pd-bosun supervisor not installed (optional)\r\n    Last activity: 19s ago\r\n"]
